    {
      "content": "EXACT PUBLIC STATE AFTER TURN 6; NO PRIVATE OR FUTURE DATA\nPUBLIC_STATE_JSON:\n{\"completed_task_turns\":[{\"turn\":1,\"user_message\":\"Solve this problem step by step. Put your final answer within \\\\boxed{}.\\n\\nWhat savings interest rate does Anthony's bank account offer? Anthony has saved $12.00 more than his sister Eva. Eva has saved $25.00.\"},{\"turn\":2,\"user_message\":\"Wait, I made a mistake. Anthony has saved $10.00 more than his sister Eva.\"},{\"turn\":3,\"user_message\":\"Actually, that was wrong. Eva has saved $20.00.\"},{\"turn\":4,\"user_message\":\"Oh, I forgot to mention: Anthony's savings account offers 3% annual interest.\"},{\"turn\":5,\"user_message\":\"Great. Now let's take that a step further. How much money will Anthony have after one year, including his bank interest?\"},{\"turn\":6,\"user_message\":\"I should also tell you: Interest is calculated once on the original balance after one year.\"}],\"public_metadata\":{\"benchmark\":\"Evolving Intent GSM8K\",\"upstream_commit\":\"993d6be9597ac03854b46362ccd647eb1bfd267a\"}}",
