  "task_assistant_messages": [
    "1. Eva has saved \\$25.00.\n2. Anthony has saved \\$12.00 more:\n\n\\[\n25+12=\\$37\n\\]\n\n3. However, no information is given about interest earned, time, or an account balance before and after interest.\n\nTherefore, the bank’s savings interest rate **cannot be determined** from the information provided.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\text{The interest rate cannot be determined}}\n\\]",
    "Eva has saved \\$25.00, and Anthony has saved \\$10.00 more:\n\n\\[\n25+10=35\n\\]\n\nAnthony has saved **\\$35.00**, but there is still no information about interest earned or time. Thus, the savings interest rate cannot be determined.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\text{The interest rate cannot be determined}}\n\\]",
    "Eva has saved \\$20.00, and Anthony has saved \\$10.00 more:\n\n\\[\n20+10=30\n\\]\n\nAnthony has saved \\$30.00. However, the interest rate still cannot be determined because no interest amount or time period is given.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\text{The interest rate cannot be determined}}\n\\]",
    "Anthony’s savings account offers an annual interest rate of **3%**.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{3\\%}\n\\]",
